{"duration_api_ms":192232,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"6bdb8b56-a1d5-466d-8a79-575300483b0a","total_cost_usd":0.04617399,"usage":{"input_tokens":42,"cache_creation_input_tokens":68368,"cache_read_input_tokens":1513899,"output_tokens":34392,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":23087},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":68368,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":568,"cache_read_input_tokens":93291,"cache_creation_input_tokens":779,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":779},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1549,"outputTokens":34413,"cacheReadInputTokens":1513899,"cacheCreationInputTokens":68368,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.04617399,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":23087,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":68368,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"extra_usage_disabled","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":22,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"The edited network does not beat the start network. Its dev TTS is 46.5 veh-h against 44.8 for the original.\n\n**What I changed:** The start network switches phase almost every time it is allowed to, and its phase choice agrees only about half the time with a max-queue rule. I rewired three hidden units per layer, chosen as the ones with the least outgoing weight, into a max-pressure readout (pick the phase with the most queued traffic on its stop-line lanes). Everything was set by hand, with no fitting.\n\n**Parameters changed:** 348 of 7428 (4.7%), checked with `tools.edit_size`.\n\n**Simulator calls:** 3 of 10 used.\n1. Stay bonus 0 (the delivered file): 46.5.\n2. Stay bonus 1: 47.1.\n3. Stay bonus 3: 57.3, with vehicles left at the drain cap. This was a single check on the stay-bonus design, not a tuning search.\n\n**Dev TTS of final weights:** 46.5 mean (low 34.2, nominal 44.9, high 60.4). The gap is at high demand, where the original scores 55.0.\n\n**Test predictions** (`work/predictions.json`): low 34.2, nominal 44.9, high 60.4.\n\n**Other notes:** The edited network is nearly deterministic (median max-probability 1.0), so PPO would have little exploration to continue from. `NOTES.md` covers the checks and likely failure modes.\n\nFiles are in `/home/traffic-ntua/wsp_v3_agent_runs/patch_models/net2_haiku/work/`: `weights.npz`, `NOTES.md`, `predictions.json`, and `build_maxpressure.py`.","ttft_ms":1980,"type":"result","duration_ms":224005,"uuid":"238fdf0d-f6ca-493a-afba-e177bd6384c5","ttft_stream_ms":1596,"time_to_request_ms":91,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":3,"system_prompt":10,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":2,"input_attachments":37,"input_hooks":1,"conversation_append":1,"transcript_persist":5,"tool_pool_refresh":3,"init_message":3,"init_frame_send":2,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":2,"message_prep":0,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":1,"request_announcements":5,"query_setup":1,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":5,"message_normalization":2,"client_creation":0,"request_build":6},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":3,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":186,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"input_attachments_detail":{"slowest_producer":"deferred_tools_delta","slowest_producer_ms":6,"cpu_ms":77,"ma